129
00:05:10.916 --> 00:05:11.749
Right.

130
00:05:11.749 --> 00:05:13.207
Rams, the victors.

131
00:05:13.207 --> 00:05:14.665
LA celebrating.

132
00:05:14.665 --> 00:05:15.948
LA title town.

133
00:05:15.948 --> 00:05:17.917
Three titles in what, two years?

134
00:05:17.917 --> 00:05:18.750
Something like that.

135
00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:19.708
Three sports, come on.

136
00:05:19.708 --> 00:05:22.222
Plus an epic halftime show.

137
00:05:22.222 --> 00:05:23.162
It really was good.

138
00:05:23.162 --> 00:05:24.486
I feared for the halftime show

139
00:05:24.486 --> 00:05:29.120
'cause anytime a bunch of old guys get together, do their...

140
00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:31.690
I knew Kendrick Lamar would be good.

141
00:05:31.690 --> 00:05:34.894
And I had a feeling Mary J. Blige would be great,

142
00:05:34.894 --> 00:05:36.615
a voice like that, it doesn't matter.

143
00:05:36.615 --> 00:05:37.948
You're always gonna be good.

144
00:05:37.948 --> 00:05:41.310
I worried about the other guys, but they were fantastic.

145
00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:42.493
Yeah, I thought it was pretty great.

146
00:05:42.493 --> 00:05:43.326
Fantastic.

147
00:05:43.326 --> 00:05:46.608
And it was entertaining to see certain factions

148
00:05:46.608 --> 00:05:49.198
of the more conservative part

149
00:05:49.198 --> 00:05:51.523
