1056
00:41:05.408 --> 00:41:06.491
Alberta, Canada.

1057
00:41:06.491 --> 00:41:07.558
Alberta, Canada (laughs)

1058
00:41:07.558 --> 00:41:08.641
Oh, wait, he's American.

1059
00:41:08.641 --> 00:41:09.589
Yeah.

1060
00:41:09.589 --> 00:41:10.934
He is American.

1061
00:41:10.934 --> 00:41:14.377
He is from Ocala, Florida as well.

1062
00:41:14.377 --> 00:41:16.729
