1069
00:41:30.168 --> 00:41:34.052
with no ice rink produced three Olympic speed skaters.

1070
00:41:34.052 --> 00:41:37.447
The third being that woman, Brittany Bowe,

1071
00:41:37.447 --> 00:41:40.304
who gave up her spot for Erin Jackson.

1072
00:41:40.304 --> 00:41:41.589
No ice rink.

1073
00:41:41.589 --> 00:41:42.422
Yeah.

1074
00:41:42.422 --> 00:41:46.922
So, it's like this small inline skating club in Ocala.

1075
00:41:47.894 --> 00:41:51.311
And this woman who kind of runs this club

1076
00:41:52.252 --> 00:41:54.571
that has produced all of like,

1077
00:41:54.571 --> 00:41:58.150
ironically produced all of these talented people

1078
00:41:58.150 --> 00:42:00.105
that have become Olympians-

1079
00:42:00.105 --> 00:42:00.938
Unbelievable.

1080
00:42:00.938 --> 00:42:02.767
Without any ice rink in the town.

1081
00:42:02.767 --> 00:42:03.725
Aw.

1082
00:42:03.725 --> 00:42:05.183
How Olympics is this story?

1083
00:42:05.183 --> 00:42:06.141
Yeah, it's pretty cool.

1084
00:42:06.141 --> 00:42:07.958
This feels like a movie, you know?

1085
